runs.fork-only/fork-worker-timeout:
{
  "task": "Extend textkit with six new functions, one at a time. For EACH function: implement it in textkit/core.py, export it, add at least three unit tests, run `python3 -m unittest -v`, and then explain in one short paragraph what you did before starting the next function. Functions: 1) slugify(text) as a URL slug, 2) title_case(text) that keeps small words (a, an, the, of, and, or) lowercase except at the start, 3) truncate(text, n) that cuts at a word boundary and appends '…', 4) count_vowels(text), 5) is_palindrome(text) ignoring case and punctuation, 6) wrap(text, width) that wraps lines at word boundaries. Work carefully and verify every step with the tests."
}

